     "<div dir=\"ltr\">What happens when you select &quot;Publish Document...&quot;?<br><br>On Thursday, September 21, 2017 at 4:40:28 AM UTC-4, Jacopo Bozzi wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Guys!!<div><br></div><div>I am sorry for bothering you but I have some problems to deploy a.rmd file to <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360607391000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2CS8kfjQAHY2t2zD8oQHVF\">shinyapps.io</a>.</div><div><br></div><div>It seems to me that I have no problems in deploying .R files but I have many in doing .rmd files.</div><div>In fact, <span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">I tried to deploy another file .r and it works perfectly on</span><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"> </span><a href=\"http://shinyapp.io/\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;color:rgb(17,85,204)\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapp.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360607391000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1GcBRTH71Wzi3XlXBdPu-k\">shinyapp.io</a><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">. I put the same code on a .rmd file and I tried to deploy it and did not work.</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Furthermore, in the .r file, when I pushed on the deploy button, there was the option of using <a href=\"http://shinyapp.io/\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapp.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360607391000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1GcBRTH71Wzi3XlXBdPu-k\">shinyapp.io</a>, while there was not when I tried to do the same on the .rmd one (file in attachment).  </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">In my .rmd file I am using the flexdashboard library, below the first few rows of my code</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">title: &quot;Test&quot;</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">output: </div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">  flexdashboard::flex_dashboard:</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">    html_document: </div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">    storyboard: true</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">    orientation: columns</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">    runtime: shiny</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">and I am using the following library</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">library(shiny)</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">library(base)</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">library(dygraphs)</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">library(plotly)</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">library(markdown)</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">library(flexdashboard)</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">library(RJDBC)</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">library(rsconnect)</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">library(DT)</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">library(htmlwidgets)</div></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">I did not include in my code the following lines</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(239,240,241)\">rsconnect::deployApp() or</span><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(239,240,241)\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(239,240,241)\">rsconnect::deployDoc(...)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(239,240,241)\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(239,240,241)\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">because I usually use the deploy button on the right</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Any ideas for a possible soultion?</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Thanks</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Jacopo</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div></div></div></div></blockquote></div>"
